scenario forecast over lis
  tally 2
  from 2026-01-01
  note "Our forecast, as we see it on 2026-01-15 (story § The forecast): items 1, 2 and 6 here; the price paths (item 3) stack on it (base, crash, flat, switch); item 5 is forecast.tally; the what-if (item 7) stacks on each path (t25_<path>)."
  note "GEN-1 .3 leaves each later year's Spring Day unsettled, and a year's holidays are one list (O:A-3), so the forecast assumes it."

version fc_moves
  cite story
  governs 2026-01-01..
  known 2026-01-15
  note "the forecast's figures; fc_on turns on the forecast's rules of prices.tally, plan.tally and forecast.tally"
  replace fc_on = true "story § The forecast: the walk as we see it on 2026-01-15"
  replace plan_until = 2035-12 "story § The forecast, item 5: the walk runs to 2035-12-31, on the holidays this version assumes"
  fc_base = 2025-12 "story § The forecast, item 3: prices move from the last market price of 2025 (market files end 2025-12-31)"
  fc_fixed[2026] = 3000.00 "story § The forecast, item 1: 3 000.00 DUK a month in 2026, 100.00 DUK more each January after that"
